        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 82664,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando esplori i dataset, è utile sapere quante volte è presente un dato, ad esempio qual è la risposta più frequente a un sondaggio.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sometimes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Method call",
            "id": 82665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per contare quante volte compare un valore in una lista come <code>answers</code>, inizia con il nome della lista, un punto <code> .</code> e poi <code>count()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sometimes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"answers.count()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>answers</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>count()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Element to count",
            "id": 82666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per contare quante volte compare <code>\"yes\"</code> nell'elenco <code>answers</code>, inseriamo <code>\"yes\"</code> tra le parentesi di <code>count()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sometimes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(answers.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"75\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>\"yes\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Any type",
            "id": 82667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare <code>count()</code> con qualsiasi tipo di valore, ad esempio controllando quanti posti liberi sono rimasti in una fila in base al numero di valori <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"free_seats = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(free_seats.count(\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"74\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Reusing",
            "id": 82668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per riutilizzare il conteggio di un valore in una lista, possiamo salvarlo in una variabile come <code>seats_count</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"free_seats = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"seats_count = free_seats.count(\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(seats_count)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>seats_count</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inserisci il valore da contare tra le parentesi di <code>count()</code>. Puoi contare i booleani e salvare il risultato in una variabile.</p><p>Conta i valori <code>True</code> in <code>free_seats</code> e salva il risultato in <code>seats_count</code>, così il codice stampa <code>2</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"free_seats = [\" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"seats_count = free_seats.count(\" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(seats_count)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>seats_count</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "At least once",
            "id": 88383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se non ci interessa sapere il numero esatto, ma solo se esiste un elemento come <code>\"sugar\"</code>, usiamo la parola chiave <code>in</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>in</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Boolean",
            "id": 88384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verificare se un elemento come <code>\"sugar\"</code> è presente in un elenco come <code>\"ingredients\"</code> ci restituisce un valore booleano, ovvero <code>True</code> o <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"sugar\"</code>, seguito da <code>in</code> e infine <code>ingredients</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usa <code>in</code> tra un valore e una lista. Restituisce <code>True</code> se il valore è presente, altrimenti <code>False</code>.</p><p>Completa il primo controllo in modo che stampi <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"sugar\"</code>, seguito da <code>in</code> e infine <code>ingredients</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store the boolean",
            "id": 88385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo riutilizzare il valore booleano restituito memorizzandolo in una variabile come <code>has_sugar</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"has_sugar = \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(has_sugar)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>has_sugar</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Memorizza nella variabile <code>has_sugar</code> se <code>\"sugar\"</code> è in <code>ingredients</code>, in modo che il codice stampi <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ingredients = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;eggs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"has_sugar = \" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ingredients\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(has_sugar)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>has_sugar</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>, <code>\"sugar\"</code>, <code>in</code> e infine <code>ingredients</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Method call",
            "id": 82721,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa fa <code>count()</code> quando riceve un valore?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ci dice con quale frequenza quel valore compare in una lista</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Conta tutti gli elementi di una lista</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ci dice con quale frequenza quel valore compare in una lista.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa restituisce <code>[\"a\", \"b\", \"a\"].count(\"a\")</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>True</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Element to count",
            "id": 82723,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dove codifichiamo l'elemento che vogliamo contare in un elenco?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tra le parentesi di <code>.count()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Prima di <code>.count()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tra le parentesi di <code>.count()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale espressione conta quante volte <code>\"banana\"</code> compare in <code>fruits</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>fruits.count(\"banana\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"banana\".count(fruits)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>fruits.count()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>fruits.count(\"banana\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Any type",
            "id": 82724,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con quali tipi di valori possiamo usare <code>count()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Stringa, booleano, intero e float</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo stringhe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Stringa, booleano, intero e float.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare <code>count()</code> con stringhe, booleani, interi e float.</p><p>Se <code>flags = [True, False, True]</code>, che cosa restituisce <code>flags.count(True)</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Provoca un errore perché <code>count()</code> accetta soltanto stringhe.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>3</code>, perché la lista contiene tre valori.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Reusing",
            "id": 82725,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo riutilizzare il risultato restituito da <code>count()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Creando una variabile e memorizzandola al suo interno</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo riutilizzare il risultato perché cambia sempre</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Creando una variabile e memorizzandola al suo interno.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Devi riutilizzare quante volte <code>\"done\"</code> compare in <code>tasks</code>. Quale riga memorizza il risultato?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>done_count = tasks.count(\"done\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(tasks.count(\"done\"))</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>tasks.count(\"done\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>done_count = tasks.count(\"done\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: At least once",
            "id": 88412,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per cosa possiamo usare la parola chiave <code>in</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Verificare se una lista contiene un elemento</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Contare il numero di occorrenze di un elemento in un elenco</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Verificare se una lista contiene un elemento.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo la parola chiave <code>in</code> per verificare se una lista contiene un elemento.</p><p>Quale espressione verifica se <code>colors</code> contiene <code>\"blue\"</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"blue\" in colors</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>colors.count(\"blue\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colors == \"blue\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"blue\" in colors</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Boolean",
            "id": 88413,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che tipo di valore otteniamo usando la parola chiave <code>in</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Un booleano come <code>True</code> o <code>False</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un numero </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Un booleano come <code>True</code> o <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La parola chiave <code>in</code> restituisce un valore booleano come <code>True</code> o <code>False</code>.</p><p>Se <code>colors = [\"red\", \"blue\"]</code>, che cosa restituisce <code>\"blue\" in colors</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"blue\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store the boolean",
            "id": 88414,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo riutilizzare il risultato booleano che indica se un elemento è o meno presente in una lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Memorizzandolo in una variabile</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo riutilizzarlo, possiamo solo visualizzarlo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Memorizzandolo in una variabile.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Devi riutilizzare se <code>colors</code> contiene <code>\"blue\"</code>. Quale riga memorizza il risultato booleano?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>has_blue = \"blue\" in colors</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"blue\" in colors)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"blue\" in colors</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>has_blue = \"blue\" in colors</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Method call",
            "id": 82726,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Conta le missioni recenti su Marte scrivendo <code>missions.count()</code> attorno al valore <code>\"Mars\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"missions = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Moon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mars&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;ISS&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mars&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(missions.count(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Mars&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>missions</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>count</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
